<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1590] IGFS: update &amp; create operations should be truly thread-safe.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1590</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Fix #create() operation &amp;amp; revise #update().&lt;br/&gt;
Currently the tests with many concurrent operations (involving  delete/rename/nkdirs/create) reveal concurrency problems &amp;#8211; some tree entries get &quot;lost&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12901616">IGNITE-1590</key>
