                            <comment id="14948635" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 8 Oct 2015 13:21:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan, several comments here.&lt;br/&gt;
1) Looks like create logic could be simplified with help of refactoring of common code base from mkdirs() and removal complex handling of unlikely case with concurrent file system update.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Append with create=true must have the same semantics as normal create - parent directories must be created.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
